#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Ashes
#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Destroyed Building
#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Ashes
#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Destroyed Building
#: input:693 input:700 standard
msgid "The remains of a destroyed building."
msgstr "De overblijfselen van een verwoest gebouw."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: One of the berry bushes
#: input:707 input:735 input:763 input:791 input:819 input:847 input:875
#: input:903 input:931 standard
msgid "This berry bush has just been planted."
msgstr "Deze bessenstruik is net geplant."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: One of the berry bushes
#: input:714 input:742 input:770 input:798 input:826 input:854 input:882
#: input:910 input:938 standard
msgid "This berry bush is growing."
msgstr "Deze bessenstruik groeit."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: One of the berry bushes
#: input:721 input:749 input:777 input:805 input:833 input:861 input:889
#: input:917 input:945 standard
msgid "This berry bush is flowering. Honey can be produced from it."
msgstr "Deze bessenstruik staat in bloei. Er kan honing van worden gemaakt."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: One of the berry bushes
#: input:728 input:756 input:784 input:812 input:840 input:868 input:896
#: input:924 input:952 standard
msgid "This berry bush is ready for harvesting."
msgstr "Deze bessenstruik is klaar om geoogst te worden."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Grapevine
#: input:959 standard
msgid "This grapevine has just been planted."
msgstr "Deze wijnstok is net geplant."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Grapevine
#: input:966 input:973 standard
msgid "This grapevine is growing."
msgstr "Deze wijnstok groeit."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Grapevine
#: input:980 standard
msgid "This grapevine is ready for harvesting."
msgstr "Deze wijnstok is klaar om geoogst te worden."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: Pond
#: input:987 standard
msgid ""
"Ponds with water becomes dry after some time. These dry holes vanish after a "
"while."
msgstr ""
"Vijvers met water staan na verloop van tijd droog. Deze droge gaten "
"verdwijnen na een tijdje."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: Pond
#: input:994 standard
msgid ""
"When gardeners dig up earth, they leave holes with water in the ground. "
"These falls dry after a while or can be used by terraformer to produce new "
"soil."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer tuiniers aarde afgraven, laten ze gaten met water achter in de "
"grond. Deze vallen na een tijdje droog of kunnen door terravormers worden "
"gebruikt om nieuwe grond te produceren."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: Reed Field
#: input:1001 standard
msgid "This reed field has just been planted."
msgstr "Dit rietveld is net geplant."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: Reed Field
#: input:1008 standard
msgid "This reed field is growing."
msgstr "Dit rietveld groeit."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: Reed Field
#: input:1015 standard
msgid "This reed field is flowering. Honey can be produced from it."
msgstr "Dit rietveld staat in bloei. Er kan honing van worden gemaakt."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: Reed Field
#: input:1022 standard
msgid "This reed field is ready for harvesting."
msgstr "Dit rietveld kan worden geoogst."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: No resources
#: input:1029 standard
msgid "There are no resources in the ground here."
msgstr "Er zitten hier geen grondstoffen in de grond."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Water
#: input:1036 standard
msgid "There is water in the ground here that can be pulled up by a well."
msgstr ""
"Er zit hier water in de grond dat kan worden opgepompt met een waterput."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Coal, part 1
#: input:1044 input:1088 standard
msgid "Coal veins contain coal that can be dug up by coal mines."
msgstr ""
"Steenkooladers bevatten steenkool die kan worden opgegraven in "
"steenkoolmijnen."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Coal, part 2
#: input:1046 standard
msgid "There is only a little bit of coal here."
msgstr "Er is hier maar een klein beetje steenkool."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Iron, part 1
#: input:1055 input:1099 standard
msgid "Iron veins contain iron ore that can be dug up by iron mines."
msgstr ""
"IJzeraders bevatten ijzererts dat kan worden opgegraven in ijzermijnen."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Iron, part 2
#: input:1057 standard
msgid "There is only a little bit of iron here."
msgstr "Er is hier maar een klein beetje ijzer."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Gold, part 1
#: input:1066 input:1110 standard
msgid "Gold veins contain gold ore that can be dug up by gold mines."
msgstr "Goudaders bevatten gouderts dat kan worden opgegraven in goudmijnen."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Gold, part 2
#: input:1068 standard
msgid "There is only a little bit of gold here."
msgstr "Er is hier maar een klein beetje goud."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Stones, part 1
#: input:1077 input:1121 standard
msgid ""
"Marble is a basic building material and can be dug up by a marble mine. You "
"will also get granite from the mine."
msgstr ""
"Marmer is een basisbouwmateriaal en kan worden opgegraven in een marmermijn. "
"Je krijgt ook graniet uit de mijn."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Stones, part 2
#: input:1079 standard
msgid "There is only a little bit of marble here."
msgstr "Er is hier maar een klein beetje marmer."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Coal, part 2
#: input:1090 standard
msgid "There is a lot of coal here."
msgstr "Er is hier veel steenkool."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Iron, part 2
#: input:1101 standard
msgid "There is a lot of iron here."
msgstr "Er is hier veel ijzer."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Gold, part 2
#: input:1112 standard
msgid "There is a lot of gold here."
msgstr "Er is hier veel goud."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Stones, part 2
#: input:1123 standard
msgid "There is a lot of marble here."
msgstr "Er is hier veel marmer."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Ship Under Construction
#: input:1131 standard
msgid "A ship is being constructed at this site."
msgstr "Op deze plek wordt een schip gebouwd."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable usable by Europeans: Dead Tree
#: input:1139 standard
msgid "The remains of an old tree."
msgstr "De resten van een oude boom."

